+
+The selected entity lives in the session under `current_entity_id`. Only the HTTP layer reads it: the `current_entity` route middleware resolves it into the in-request `TenantContext`. Users with no entity go to onboarding, users with one entity are sent to it, and users with several go to the switcher. A session value for an entity the user no longer belongs to returns 403, and the value is dropped so the next visit picks again.
